<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi Electric 8-month parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi Electric 8-month parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feb 1 to Sep 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		     (8-month)		     (full year)</p>
<p> Sales		138.59		vs	  240.17</p>
<p> Operating   loss 353    million	  vs    prft 11.03</p>
<p> Current		3.37		vs	   10.89</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1.91		vs     prft 3.12</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 36.88 yen	  vs    prft 60.79 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     52 million	  vs	  52 million</p>
<p> Ord div		5.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd makes electronic parts.</p>
<p>The latest results were for the eight-month period ended</p>
<p>September 30, because the company changed its business</p>
<p>term. The comparison figures were for a full-year period</p>
<p>which ended on Janury 31, 1996. especially system components.</p>
</text>
